    "analytic_consumers": "Finite complete real Hilbert/Borel E incl0; arbitrary measurable S; actual global C2 V,kappa>=1, allx/v Hessian kappa^-1 normv^2..normv^2; actual measurable eta/y with everyeta>0. No uppercap or supplied selector/estimate/probability certificate.",
