  "mathematical_reader_findings": {
    "range": "Actual eta>0; source S3.SS1.p1.1 separate from neighborLemma4.1 eta<=1 and numerical1/(2beta)cap. Pointwise c_s=eta_s/(1+eta_s)<1 may have supremum1. Measurable zero-start iterates and pointwise Banach limits produce p without uniform gap/cap/convergence/runtime guarantee.",
    "oracle": "Exact growth half(kappa^-1+eta^-1),unique minimum,equaleta p coefficient1; literal joint G gradV(p+sqrteta z) input/noise1 andsqrteta; true Gaussian-output Markov law, distinct from posterior/HMC.",
